# Paths that no test reads. git-autopush leaves them out of the test key,
# so a push that changes only these paths reuses an earlier pass.
# One git pathspec glob per line. Check each new line with one suite run in
# a throwaway clone without the listed files.
# test/public.test.ts reads every tracked file for local paths; that does not
# count, because the pre-commit hook public-check checks each staged file.
AGENTS.md
LICENSE
.mark*.toml
.git-autopush-untested
